		)
		(property "Description" "NFC tank trim, 0805 high-Q C0G +/-2% (Johanson S-series, ultra-low ESR). PLACED at assembly as of 2026-07-30 - value derived, not trimmed: coil L = 0.958 uH by Greenhouse on the board's 7 rails, ferrite-loaded 1.05-1.30 uH, tag Ci = 50 pF (NT3H2211 Table 42), antenna Cc = 6 pF (AN11276 Table 2). 47 pF lands the enclosed resonance at 14.45 MHz against AN11276 4.2.1's 14.5 MHz single-tag target and stays above the 13.56 carrier across the whole ferrite range. Was 82 pF + DNP, which sat at 12.5 MHz enclosed - under the carrier, the wrong side to miss on."
			(at 0 0 90)
			(layer "B.Fab")
			(hide yes)
